Apartment Association Platform
Copyright (c) 2026 Aleksandr Kuhhar

The software in this repository is source-available: it is licensed under the Elastic
License 2.0, reproduced verbatim below, together with the Additional Permissions at the end
of this file. The licensor is Aleksandr Kuhhar or his successors and assigns.

In short: an apartment association may run the software for itself free of charge, forever,
and anyone may help it do so on infrastructure the association controls. Hosting the software
on your own infrastructure for associations other than your own, selling a recurring service
for it (updates, support) to more than one association, or offering it as a service, needs a
separate written license from the licensor.

